    "guideHtml": "<div class=\"row\"><label>User Guide ++arr</label><div><h5>Overview ++arr</h5><ul><li>Start page with search, favorites, to-do, notes, weather, news. ++arr</li><li>All local: data stays in yer browser (localStorage). ++arr</li></ul><h5>Shortcuts ++arr</h5><ul><li>Ctrl/Cmd+K: open command palette ++arr</li><li>1-9: open first 9 favorites (when not typing) ++arr</li><li>/ : focus search (also via palette) ++arr</li><li>Enter in search: start search ++arr</li><li>ESC: close modals ++arr</li><li>Palette: quick actions for widgets, theme, background, data, favorites ++arr</li><li>Palette: key C switches card style, \"Reset header colors\" resets search & clock ++arr</li></ul><h5>Search & Autocomplete ++arr</h5><ul><li>Bangs:  ++arr!g  ++arr!ddg  ++arr!bing  ++arr!yt  ++arr!wiki  ++arr!maps</li><li>Custom shortcuts: JSON in settings;  ++arr{q} as placeholder ++arr</li><li>Autocomplete: bangs, shortcuts, recent searches, wordlist (global + preset) ++arr</li><li>Tab accepts suggestion, Enter starts search ++arr</li></ul><h5>Tiles ++arr</h5><ul><li>Drag & drop to sort, click to open ++arr</li><li>+ Tile: add a new favorite ++arr</li><li>Reset: restore default favorites ++arr</li></ul><h5>Widgets & Layout ++arr</h5><ul><li>Visibility per widget ++arr</li><li>Card style is global (glass, solid, transparent, soft minimal) ++arr</li><li>Custom colors for clock/search; reset restores style defaults ++arr</li><li>Widget colors & \"Tint widgets\" set the accent per card ++arr</li></ul><h5>Background ++arr</h5><ul><li>Presets, uploads, collections, rotation (time/theme/interval) ++arr</li><li>Accent color is extracted from the active background ++arr</li></ul><h5>Data ++arr</h5><ul><li>Export/Import as JSON ++arr</li><li>Load data presets (assets/presets/*.json in the repo) ++arr</li></ul><h5>Startpage Agent</h5><ul><li>Integrated AI chat with local Ollama (host/model in settings).</li><li>Supports streaming responses, stop (button/ESC), persistent history, and Markdown.</li><li>Agentic tools can read/change widgets and settings (depending on confirm mode).</li></ul></div></div>",
    "general": {
